    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e8da38c79f9b718ed9d952b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从零开始……伏特加似乎想找出自己追寻的\n目标，与自己真正想要的跑法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6ca3e9c06de2839768f0a1cff3509987bc015fc1703b55fa2ba8a48838fba8f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
